最后，构造SQL语句。使用JOIN连接orders和payments，然后SELECT所需的字段。例如：

SELECT orders.id, orders.user_id, orders.status, orders.created_at, payments.amount, payments.method, payments.paid_at
FROM orders
JOIN payments ON orders.id = payments.order_id;

